==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Glowstick Guys]] spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[MikuGory]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Snow Miku 2021 (Enemy)|Snow Miku 2021]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[MikuGory]] spawns.
**3 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**15 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
There are 2 ways you can approach this level. One is to use the [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal Enemies]] to your advantage and use them as stepping stones for [[Wave Attack|Wave]] or [[Long Distance]] attackers. The second way is to try to kill the Metal enemies quickly to make an opening for rusher-class units like [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]] or [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]].

